<title>USA: Texas/w Okla fed cattle market at standstill - USDA.</title>
<headline>Texas/w Okla fed cattle market at standstill - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>AMARILLO 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade was at a standstill in the Panhandle area early Monday, USDA said. Slaughter steers and heifers were not tested. Feedlots reporting moderate inquiry from buyers.</p>
<p>The last established price was 63.00 on Friday. Today's packer bids were 62.00, asking prices mostly 63.00-64.00. Confirmed - None</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720))</p>
</text>
